44
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:42,490
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">A Funeral March</font></font>

45
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:42,490
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">For the Living</font></font>

46
00:01:45,370 --> 00:01:47,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Why...</font>

47
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:52,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does such
a good man have to... die?!</font>

48
00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's sad...
It's so sad!</font>

49
00:02:07,690 --> 00:02:09,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remember now...</font>

50
00:02:09,690 --> 00:02:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I forgot when,
but you showed it to me, didn't you?</font>

51
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:17,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With a twinkle in your eye,</font>

52
00:02:17,650 --> 00:02:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you proudly said it was
a memento of your father.</font>

53
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was the pipe box, wasn't it?
It was an amazing box.</font>

54
00:02:24,790 --> 00:02:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wonder you're so proud of it...</font>

55
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though I took it and smashed it,
you only laughed.</font>

56
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were smiling when
we kicked you and tossed you.</font>

57
00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a great smile.</font>

58
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:43,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really...</font>

59
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:48,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it in, Rokusuke!
They'll all be gone.</font>

60
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we let this moment go,</font>

61
00:02:49,690 --> 00:02:52,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there will be no other chance
to get out of the village.</font>

62
00:02:52,510 --> 00:02:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Kanpachi is...!</font>

63
00:02:54,770 --> 00:02:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's for the village,</font>

64
00:02:56,600 --> 00:03:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we have to do something and
make our way to that village!</font>

65
00:03:11,340 --> 00:03:12,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

66
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:15,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Funerals are awesome, aren't they!</font>

67
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanna do that again.</font>

68
00:03:23,970 --> 00:03:30,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One... two... three people...
got away again...</font>

69
00:03:31,730 --> 00:03:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like we can have
another funeral.</font>

70
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

71
00:03:57,770 --> 00:03:59,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

72
00:04:00,790 --> 00:04:01,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...?</font>

73
00:04:03,330 --> 00:04:07,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto! Right now,
I'm in the middle of training.</font>

74
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

75
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey! I said hey!</font>

76
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:14,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there!</font>

77
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is training too...!</font>

78
00:04:46,990 --> 00:04:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't give up yet! Not yet!</font>

79
00:04:57,880 --> 00:05:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The escort for the ruler of
the Land of Swamps, Lord Chichiyasu,</font>

80
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:01,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was completed without incident!</font>

81
00:05:02,330 --> 00:05:02,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done.</font>

82
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Tsunade-sama's...!</font>

83
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellent dumplings are always
from the Leaf Village, aren't they?</font>

84
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:15,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was my last one!</font>

85
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mission Accomplished!</font>

86
00:05:24,550 --> 00:05:26,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to pound the pirates
of the Gottani Channel</font>

87
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:29,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the fist of love!</font>

88
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:33,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they take this opportunity
to rehabilitate themselves,</font>

89
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:37,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's worth while to shed a tear!</font>

90
00:05:45,570 --> 00:05:47,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have your team do it for me.</font>

91
00:05:48,530 --> 00:05:49,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes?</font>

92
00:05:50,990 --> 00:05:55,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though we're already busy,
that Naruto brought in more work.</font>

93
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:59,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After this, Guy has the S-rank mission.</font>

94
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The client picked him,
so he must depart today.</font>

95
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:06,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, do it without Guy.</font>

96
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's pretty straightforward...</font>

97
00:06:09,890 --> 00:06:13,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I called Hyuga Neji,
Tenten and Lee.</font>

98
00:06:13,220 --> 00:06:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ohh!</font>

99
00:06:14,550 --> 00:06:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My pupils can undertake the fulfillment
of this mission without incident!</font>

100
00:06:19,050 --> 00:06:19,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait...</font>

101
00:06:21,830 --> 00:06:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take Uzumaki Naruto, too.</font>

102
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why can't it just be my pupils,
who are loved by all the world?</font>

103
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please answer me, Tsunade-sama!</font>

104
00:06:31,870 --> 00:06:32,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It just is.</font>

105
00:06:39,670 --> 00:06:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Leaf Hospital</font>

106
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those three people that Naruto saved
came all the way</font>

107
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:46,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the Katabami Gold Mine
to request a mission.</font>

108
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Katabami Gold Mine is one of
the Land of Rivers' greatest mines,</font>

109
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but about half a year ago, hooligans
calling themselves the Kurosuki family</font>

110
00:06:54,850 --> 00:06:58,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">appeared on the pretext of guarding it,
and took control of the village...</font>

111
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">killing villagers for
no particular reason.</font>

112
00:07:03,610 --> 00:07:05,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How vile!</font>

113
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:07,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your mission is this:</font>

114
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once those three have
regained their strength,</font>

115
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:14,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">escort them to Katabami Gold Mine
and eliminate the Kurosuki family.</font>

116
00:07:14,910 --> 00:07:16,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a simple mission.</font>

117
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:19,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well anyway, it must be a group
of punks who're after money.</font>

118
00:07:20,900 --> 00:07:24,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you call me for
such an easy mission?</font>

119
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who do you think you are?</font>

120
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm busy searching for
Sasuke and training, and...!</font>

121
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:37,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You forced your way into missions
that you weren't called for.</font>

122
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a Genin's place
to choose his missions!</font>

123
00:07:40,260 --> 00:07:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Would you like to be sent back
to the Academy? Well?!</font>

124
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:45,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hyuga Neji!
— Yes!</font>

125
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the leader!</font>

126
00:07:47,790 --> 00:07:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will be good training for you
to try to tame the unstable.</font>

127
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to...
but, I'll do it!</font>

128
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go continue my training!</font>

129
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

130
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please excuse them.
They have no manners...</font>

131
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:11,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

132
00:08:18,850 --> 00:08:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those little brats...!</font>

133
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell do
they think missions are?!</font>

134
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm, excuse me?</font>

135
00:08:24,850 --> 00:08:25,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

136
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kurosuki Family...</font>

137
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:29,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say
their boss' name was?</font>

138
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga!</font>

139
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I thought...</font>

140
00:08:32,900 --> 00:08:33,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

141
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, on a previous mission,
I heard a rumor about him.</font>

142
00:08:39,900 --> 00:08:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A rumor...?</font>

143
00:08:41,100 --> 00:08:45,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage hasn't returned...
I'm forced to go on a mission...</font>

144
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:47,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, this is irritating...</font>

145
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:50,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

146
00:08:50,990 --> 00:08:51,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?</font>

147
00:08:51,980 --> 00:08:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on? A bird?</font>

148
00:08:55,500 --> 00:08:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yesterday I found it injured
and treated it, but...</font>

149
00:09:13,740 --> 00:09:15,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, that's amazing!</font>

150
00:09:18,930 --> 00:09:20,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But poor thing.</font>

151
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's separated from its friends.</font>

152
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:29,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

153
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, sorry, did I intrude?</font>

154
00:09:33,130 --> 00:09:34,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You intruded big time!</font>

155
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:36,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no!</font>

156
00:09:37,100 --> 00:09:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't turn your back,
no need to grovel to youth.</font>

157
00:09:41,990 --> 00:09:43,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, Hello!</font>

158
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hello!</font>

159
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you come here for?</font>

160
00:09:47,990 --> 00:09:49,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Just to have a word.
— Huh? What the...?!</font>

161
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Sakura, goodbye!</font>

162
00:09:51,230 --> 00:09:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey! What was that?!
— She went wild, didn't she?</font>

163
00:09:53,730 --> 00:09:56,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She should act her age.</font>

164
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:03,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! The boss of
the Kurosuki family</font>

165
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is one of the Seven Ninja
Swordsmen of the Mist?</font>

166
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, it's exclusive information
from our respected teacher, Guy.</font>

167
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're the Seven Ninja
Swordsmen of the Mist?</font>

168
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you said that</font>

169
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you fought in the Land of
the Waves mission, didn't you?</font>

170
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time...</font>

171
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Zabuza! And?</font>

172
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:29,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Guy-sensei and Kakashi-sensei
fought Kisame Hoshigaki.</font>

173
00:10:30,130 --> 00:10:32,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that
you met them there too, Naruto.</font>

174
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! I know that guy!</font>

175
00:10:37,890 --> 00:10:39,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two were once called</font>

176
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Seven Ninja Swordsmen
 of the Mist.</font>

177
00:10:43,860 --> 00:10:46,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And at that time,
who was with Kisame Hoshigaki?</font>

178
00:10:46,890 --> 00:10:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

179
00:10:48,990 --> 00:10:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The man called Itachi!
And then?</font>

180
00:10:53,310 --> 00:10:54,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still don't understand?</font>

181
00:10:55,330 --> 00:10:58,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Raiga is one of the Seven Ninja
Swordsmen of the Mist,</font>

182
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:02,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then he's probably tied to Itachi
who was with Kisame.</font>

183
00:11:03,470 --> 00:11:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! And?</font>

184
00:11:05,670 --> 00:11:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell me, who's after Itachi?</font>

185
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:11,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know! Sasuke!</font>

186
00:11:11,250 --> 00:11:12,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

187
00:11:13,990 --> 00:11:15,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can probably get
the clue to Sasuke's whereabouts</font>

188
00:11:15,690 --> 00:11:17,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at Katabami Gold Mine!</font>

189
00:11:17,850 --> 00:11:18,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

190
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:21,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's what Guy-sensei said then...</font>

191
00:11:23,370 --> 00:11:25,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say anything rude!</font>

192
00:11:25,780 --> 00:11:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's information that's
100% reliable!</font>

193
00:11:33,260 --> 00:11:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Starting now,
while guarding Rokusuke and the others,</font>

194
00:11:35,990 --> 00:11:37,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we head toward Katabami Gold Mine</font>

195
00:11:37,890 --> 00:11:39,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to fulfill our mission to
wipe out the Kurosuki family.</font>

196
00:11:40,300 --> 00:11:42,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a shop I'm familiar
with close to the gold mine.</font>

197
00:11:43,500 --> 00:11:44,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's make that the base.</font>

198
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:47,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean
a shop you're familiar with?</font>

199
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the fun part of the trip.</font>

200
00:11:51,510 --> 00:11:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That aside, that Naruto is late...</font>

201
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the source of the information
is Guy-sensei,</font>

202
00:11:56,610 --> 00:11:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">maybe he couldn't quite trust it?</font>

203
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true!
Naruto will definitely come!</font>

204
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's because Guy-sensei's
information is correct!</font>

205
00:12:06,630 --> 00:12:07,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever.</font>

206
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I am!</font>

207
00:12:12,250 --> 00:12:14,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're all here so...!</font>

208
00:12:16,300 --> 00:12:17,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that for you to say?!</font>

209
00:12:17,660 --> 00:12:19,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

210
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:23,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... which way?</font>

211
00:12:50,990 --> 00:12:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so anxious, Rokusuke,</font>

212
00:12:52,710 --> 00:12:55,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys will save our town.</font>

213
00:12:59,910 --> 00:13:01,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's post-meal training!</font>

214
00:13:03,990 --> 00:13:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose!</font>

215
00:13:12,770 --> 00:13:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose!</font>

216
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long do you intend
to rest here?!</font>

217
00:13:21,990 --> 00:13:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we hurry, we can save Kanpachi
from the burial...</font>

218
00:13:24,990 --> 00:13:26,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it up...</font>

219
00:13:26,780 --> 00:13:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long do you think
it's been since that happened?</font>

220
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:30,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's painful but...</font>

221
00:13:38,500 --> 00:13:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remember... this sleepiness.
The shop is close by.</font>

222
00:13:43,850 --> 00:13:46,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You say you're sleepy,
and are you walking in your sleep?!</font>

223
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay.</font>

224
00:13:48,350 --> 00:13:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I slept while on a marathon on
this road for three days straight.</font>

225
00:13:53,310 --> 00:13:54,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are joking, right?</font>

226
00:13:54,810 --> 00:13:56,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true.</font>

227
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The track meet of my youth
with Guy-sensei.</font>

228
00:13:59,530 --> 00:14:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body still remembers it.</font>

229
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've gotten sleepy.</font>

230
00:14:04,340 --> 00:14:06,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Bushy Brow,
are you really okay?</font>

231
00:14:06,950 --> 00:14:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. In this area,
there's the scent of spicy curry.</font>

232
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:14,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Curry? Now that you mention it...</font>

233
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right!</font>

234
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:20,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there, it's...
the Curry of Life Shop!</font>

235
00:14:25,990 --> 00:14:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Sansho!</font>

236
00:14:27,830 --> 00:14:29,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my...
Oh goodness!</font>

237
00:14:29,930 --> 00:14:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't seen you for a while!</font>

238
00:14:31,550 --> 00:14:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh my my my!
— You're looking well!</font>

239
00:14:33,890 --> 00:14:36,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the shop Lee is familiar with?</font>

240
00:14:39,020 --> 00:14:41,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That mountain is
the Katabami Gold Mine</font>

241
00:14:49,710 --> 00:14:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Sansho's curry saved my life.</font>

242
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:55,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're saying
it's delicious curry?</font>

243
00:14:55,910 --> 00:15:00,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it really saved my life.
I'm indebted to this curry.</font>

244
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:03,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was when
I'd just become a Genin...</font>

245
00:15:03,990 --> 00:15:07,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Guy-sensei gave me
a special training routine.</font>

246
00:15:08,670 --> 00:15:13,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, that's right.
I remember.</font>

247
00:15:15,970 --> 00:15:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do your best!</font>

248
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my...</font>

249
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Grandma Sansho!</font>

250
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, they've come again!</font>

251
00:15:35,770 --> 00:15:38,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those people are running in their sleep.</font>

252
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:44,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi! Karashi!</font>

253
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you had that kind of energy,
you wouldn't lose to the bullies.</font>

254
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:58,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my,
I might have said too much.</font>

255
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Curry of Life Shop</font>

256
00:16:20,410 --> 00:16:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my! It's the third day.</font>

257
00:16:22,550 --> 00:16:24,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've been running the whole time.</font>

258
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my. What a problem.</font>

259
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he's hungry...?</font>

260
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:59,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pickle! He's not waking up!</font>

261
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I didn't use
enough spice?</font>

262
00:17:17,830 --> 00:17:18,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi...</font>

263
00:17:20,990 --> 00:17:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen a person
who works this hard.</font>

264
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh really... so you want to help
this young man too...?</font>

265
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:50,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the curry of life.</font>

266
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now! Grandma Sansho went to
the trouble of making this curry.</font>

267
00:17:57,580 --> 00:17:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's eat!</font>

268
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:00,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm digging in!</font>

269
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yum!
This is yummy-yum delicious!</font>

270
00:18:32,340 --> 00:18:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Delicious! The use of spices
is wonderful!</font>

271
00:18:36,330 --> 00:18:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this rice
goes perfectly with the curry!</font>

272
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Delicious!</font>

273
00:18:56,520 --> 00:18:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, I don't see Karashi.</font>

274
00:18:59,570 --> 00:19:02,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi saw how hard you worked</font>

275
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:05,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and became a bright kid
full of energy, but...</font>

276
00:19:05,770 --> 00:19:09,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He got too much energy
and left for town.</font>

277
00:19:09,370 --> 00:19:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

278
00:19:10,850 --> 00:19:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was wrong to keep telling him
to be stronger.</font>

279
00:19:15,790 --> 00:19:16,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I'm going to be a man!"</font>

280
00:19:17,210 --> 00:19:19,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I'm going to be part of
the Kurosuki family," he said.</font>

281
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:28,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my! I'm not blaming you.
Don't worry.</font>

282
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:29,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late.</font>

283
00:19:29,900 --> 00:19:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm responsible...</font>

284
00:19:31,990 --> 00:19:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my.</font>

285
00:19:33,520 --> 00:19:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

286
00:19:35,040 --> 00:19:38,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please include Karashi's rescue
into our mission!</font>

287
00:19:38,220 --> 00:19:40,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll bring him back from
the road of evil!</font>

288
00:19:46,050 --> 00:19:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's fine.</font>

289
00:19:50,410 --> 00:19:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll use this shop as a base
and take a good look into the village.</font>

290
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we'll come up with a strategy
and spring into action.</font>

291
00:19:58,260 --> 00:19:59,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

292
00:20:01,770 --> 00:20:03,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys await orders here.</font>

293
00:20:04,850 --> 00:20:06,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because it's dangerous
if the Kurosuki family finds us.</font>

294
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a disaster!</font>

295
00:20:14,150 --> 00:20:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rokusuke! Rokusuke!
He's gone!</font>

296
00:20:20,550 --> 00:20:23,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure he went to town alone!</font>

297
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not good!</font>

298
00:20:24,900 --> 00:20:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If those guys find Rokusuke...!</font>

299
00:20:29,490 --> 00:20:30,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that it's come to this,</font>

300
00:20:30,500 --> 00:20:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we don't have time
to come up with a strategy!</font>

301
00:20:32,990 --> 00:20:34,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get right to it!</font>

302
00:20:35,900 --> 00:20:36,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

303
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:38,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll get right to it!</font>

304
00:20:41,970 --> 00:20:42,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry.</font>

305
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait for me, Kanpachi,
I'm coming now...</font>

306
00:20:54,630 --> 00:20:56,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone... is coming...</font>

307
00:20:57,880 --> 00:21:02,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aw, again...
I have to put on a funeral!</font>

308
00:21:16,890 --> 00:21:21,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kusottare na nyuusu ga toori sugite</font></b></font></font></font>

309
00:21:16,890 --> 00:21:21,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">crappy news pass us by</font></b></font></font></font>

310
00:21:21,180 --> 00:21:23,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kimi wa kotoba wo nakusu</font></b></font></font></font>

311
00:21:21,180 --> 00:21:23,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">and you become speechless</font></b></font></font></font>

312
00:21:26,150 --> 00:21:30,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">boku no koe ja marude chiisa sugite</font></b></font></font></font>

