<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">you can save someone's life
with just one serving of curry.</font>

333
00:22:48,010 --> 00:22:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Even for a person like me,</font>

334
