it's not an impossibility...</font>

335
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:54,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That's what I thought.</font>

336
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You were far more admirable
